uys  want to know about i've always been into  outreach you know any age basically kids  adults i think it's fantastic in for any  person if you can just help them  understand something like that light  bulb moment when they're finally like oh  i get it now is so gratifying as in as a  scientist that  you've made someone understand the world  that they live in  that's true but there's a subtlety here  which is that actually what you're doing  isn't the two body problems the two body  problem is if you have the sun and  something in orbit around it what you're  actually doing is a three body problem  you've got the sun you've got the earth  and you've got your satellite

